Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.408
Emergency number!

6
00:00:22.308 --> 00:00:24.798
Emergency number. Your turn!

7
00:00:27.698 --> 00:00:29.454
Emergency number!

8
00:00:29.754 --> 00:00:30.685
Great!

9
00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:33.010
Ambulance call!

10
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.318
