13
00:00:42.817 --> 00:00:44.282
First-aid kit!

14
00:00:45.182 --> 00:00:47.463
First-aid kit. Your turn!

15
00:00:50.363 --> 00:00:52.037
First-aid kit!

16
00:00:52.337 --> 00:00:53.582
Well done!

17
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:55.480
Burn!

18
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.976
Burn. Your turn!

19
00:01:00.876 --> 00:01:02.028
Burn!

20
00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.329
Yes!

21
00:01:04.317 --> 00:01:05.051
Cut!

22
00:01:05.951 --> 00:01:07.814
Cut. Your turn!

23
00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:11.424
Cut!

24
00:01:11.724 --> 00:01:12.749
Good job!

25
00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:14.739
Bruise!

26
00:01:15.639 --> 00:01:17.642
Bruise. Your turn!

27
00:01:20.542 --> 00:01:21.624
Bruise!

28
00:01:21.924 --> 00:01:22.995
Wonderful!

29
00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.101
Sprain!

30
00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:28.281
Sprain. Your turn!

31
00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:32.380
Sprain!

32
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:33.588
